It is morning time.
I am in the market near my house.
This market is very big.
There is a lot of crowd here today.
There are many sounds and colours everywhere.
Vendors are calling out to people.
I have two cloth bags in my hand.
I look at my shopping list.
There are several things on the list.
I want fresh vegetables and fruits.
Nearby, a vendor is shouting loudly.
He says, "Fresh tomatoes!"
"Only forty rupees a kilo!"
On the other side, a woman vendor is sitting.
She has very beautiful flowers.
I really like this market atmosphere.
I walk forward slowly.
There is a fruit cart ahead.
There are fresh bananas there.
I go towards that cart.
